{"license":"DANS Licence","fileAccessRequest":false,"metadataBlocks":{"citation":{"displayName":"Citation Metadata","name":"citation","fields":[{"typeName":"title","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Getuigen Verhalen, Akkers van Margraten, Verenigde Staten, interview 42"},{"typeName":"otherId","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"otherIdAgency":{"typeName":"otherIdAgency","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"DANS-KNAW"},"otherIdValue":{"typeName":"otherIdValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"easy-dataset:41829"}}]},{"typeName":"author","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Ruim Kader Films"}},{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Regionaal Historisch Centrum Limburg ©"}}]},{"typeName":"datasetContact","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"datasetContactName":{"typeName":"datasetContactName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"EJ  Jansen"}}]},{"typeName":"dsDescription","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"<p>Geïnterviewde was tweede luitenant van een bataljon Afro-Amerikaanse soldaten van de 960e Quarter Master Service Company, die de avond voor Thanksgiving 1944 te horen kregen dat ze de volgende dag moesten gaan helpen op de Amerikaanse oorlogsbegraafplaats in Margraten. Hij beschrijft de procedures als lopende band werk in een fabriek. Na twee weken wordt een deel van de begraafplaats ingericht voor Duitse gesneuvelden en de soldaten van geïnterviewde moesten de Duitsers begraven. Toen het Ardennen offensief begon vertrokken ze hals over kop: hun volgende opdracht was het uitdelen van munitie aan iedere Amerikaanse soldaat die erom vroeg.<\/p>"}},{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Date Submitted: 2010-05-15"}},{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"<p>interview in het Engels | transcriptie in het Engels| samenvatting in het Nederlands<br><br>overeenkomsten met interviewers geplaatst in dataset GV_AvM_Margraten_01<\/p>"}}]},{"typeName":"subject","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Arts and Humanities"]},{"typeName":"keyword","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Amerikaanse begraafplaats Margraten"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Oral history"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"960th Quarter Master Service Company"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"graaf- en indentificatiewerkzaamheden"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Ardennenoffensief (Battle of the Bulge)"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Afro-Amerikaanse soldaten"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Duitse gesneuvelden"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Sittard"}}]},{"typeName":"language","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["English"]},{"typeName":"productionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2010-05-15"},{"typeName":"contributor","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"contributorName":{"typeName":"contributorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"research &amp; interview: Jo Purnot (SHOM)"}},{"contributorName":{"typeName":"contributorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primi